<title>JAPAN: JNR Corp says sells Tokyo land for 86.8 bln yen.</title>
<headline>JNR Corp says sells Tokyo land for 86.8 bln yen.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>JNR Settlement Corp said on Thursday it had sold land near Tokyo Station for 86.8 billion yen at auction.  </p>
<p>The selling price was much higher than predictions of 45 billion yen.</p>
<p>A spokesman for JNR Settlement Corp said the land was bought by a subsidiary of the Pacific Century Group headed by Hong Kong businessman Richard Li.</p>
</text>
